[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶、今度のファンミーティングの件なんだが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040060020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。それなら、順調に進んでいるよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。私にイベントの企画を任せてくれて嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おかげで、ファンのみんなが喜んでくれそうなことを\r\nたくさん考えて実行することができる",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "これもプロデューサーのおかげだね\r\nアナタには本当に感謝している",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……イベントの内容やセットリストは\r\nチェックさせてもらった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "口を出すところが全然なかったよ\r\nさすが、咲耶だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "早くファンのみんなと会いたいからね\r\nついつい熱が入ってしまっているよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかし……だな\r\nひとつだけいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……？\r\nなんだい、プロデューサー。急に改まって……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "企画内容なんだが\r\nもっと咲耶のやりたいようにしてみたらどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え……？　ファンのみんなが喜んでくれるように\r\n考えていたつもりなんだが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "歌にフリートークに即興劇……それから──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030081,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……まだ、何か足りなかったかい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030081"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そうじゃなくてだな……\r\nせっかく咲耶が企画するファンミーティングなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンのことだけじゃなくて\r\n咲耶のしたいことをもっと取り入れてもいいんだぞ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど、そういうことだったんだね\r\nそれなら心配いらないよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私のしたいことは、ファンのみんなが喜ぶことさ\r\nだから、企画の内容は今のままで大丈夫だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん。そうじゃなくてだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンのみんなは、咲耶がやりたいことや好きなことを\r\n活き活きと楽しんでいる姿を見たいと思うんだが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……つまり、まずは私自身が望むことを\r\n企画に取り入れるべきだ……ということかい？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その通りだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ふむ……なるほど\r\n私自身のやりたいことか……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……あまり考えたことがないから\r\n急に言われると困ってしまうね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………\r\n私の……したいこと…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ねぇ、プロデューサーは\r\nどんなことだと思う？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030150"
  },
  {
    "select": "咲耶が笑顔に\r\nなれること",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "咲耶が楽しいと\r\n思えること",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "俺が言える\r\nことじゃない",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030160,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど……！　そうだね、まずは私が笑顔でいたほうが\r\nみんなもきっと楽しむことができるだろう",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "しかし、私が笑顔になれること……か\r\n自分のことなのに、どうもピンとこないね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶はみんなと一緒にいる時……\r\n特に、ユニットのメンバーといる時にいい笑顔をしているよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう時のことを思い出しながら\r\n考えてみたらどうだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……プロデューサーは、本当に私のことを\r\nよく見ていてくれているね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もしかしたら、私自身よりも\r\n私のことを理解してくれているのかもしれないな",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私が笑顔になれて、みんなも楽しめるような企画を\r\nもう一度考えてみるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030210"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030220,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ふむ……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンが楽しんでくれることこそが\r\n私が楽しいと思えることなのだけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それでは、ダメなのかい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンを第一に考えるのは咲耶の良いところだけど、\r\n受け身になりすぎるのもよくない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分が楽しんでいる姿で、みんなを楽しませる\r\nそれも、エンターテイナーの大事な役割だと思うぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……なるほど。確かに、プロデューサーの言う通りだね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私自身が楽しんでいる姿で、みんなを楽しませるか……\r\n新しい試みだが、なんだか楽しそうだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。それなら、今企画している即興劇に\r\nファンの子たちも巻き込んでみようかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "きっと、とても楽しいと思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030280"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっと、俺が何か言ったら、\r\n咲耶はそれを上手に取り込むからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね……\r\nアナタのアドバイスは、いつもとても的確だから",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、俺の意見じゃなくて、自分自身の気持ちを\r\nしっかり考えて欲しい……と思ってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私自身の気持ちを考える……か\r\nそんなこと、今までにあったかな",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……私はいつも……自分の気持ちを\r\n考えないようにしてきたのかもしれないな",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ゆっくりでもいいから考えよう\r\n俺も一緒に、悩んでやることはできるからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。ありがとう、プロデューサー\r\nそうだね……今は、アナタが隣にいる",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006030330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今なら目を逸らさずに……\r\n私自身の気持ちと、きちんと向き合えるような気がするよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600603/2006006030330"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]